{"name":"Envy","hex":"#8ba58f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"envy","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Resentful desire of something possessed by another or others (but not limited to material possessions). .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","An object of envious notice or feeling."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To feel displeasure or hatred towards (someone) for their good fortune or possessions.","To resentfully or discontentedly desire (something someone else has that one lacks)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/envy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Envy","blocks":[{"text":"Envy is an emotion which occurs when a person lacks another's quality, skill, achievement, or possession and either desires it or wishes that the other lacked it. Envy can also refer to the wish for another person to lack something one already possesses so as to remove the equality of possession between both parties."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg/330px-The_mad_woman-Theodore_Gericault-MBA_Lyon_B825-IMG_0477.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Envy"},{"title":"Envy (esports)","blocks":[{"text":"Envy, formerly Team Envy, is an American esports franchise based in Dallas, Texas. Founded in 2007 as a professional Call of Duty team under the moniker Team EnVyUs, they fielded rosters in Counter-Strike, FIFA, Fortnite, Gears of War, Halo, League of Legends, Chess, Magic: the Gathering, Overwatch, Paladins, PUBG, Rocket League, SMITE, StarCraft, Super Smash Bros., Street Fighter and Valorant in their original form. Following the merger between Envy Gaming and OpTic Gaming, Envy Gaming retired the Team Envy brand in June 2022, shifting all of them to the OpTic Gaming moniker."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Team_Envy_logo.svg/330px-Team_Envy_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Envy_(esports)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Giotto_-_Scrovegni_-_-48-_-_Envy.jpg/330px-Giotto_-_Scrovegni_-_-48-_-_Envy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Giotto_-_Scrovegni_-_-48-_-_Envy.jpg/330px-Giotto_-_Scrovegni_-_-48-_-_Envy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Invidia, allegorical painting by Giotto di Bondone, c. 1305–1306","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGiotto_-_Scrovegni_-_-48-_-_Envy.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Invidia%29.jpg/500px-Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Invidia%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Invidia%29.jpg/500px-Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Invidia%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Hieronymus Bosch, The Seven Deadly Sins and the Four Last Things (Invidia)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_(Invidia).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Vauxhall_Vagabond_%281953%29_%2833320873386%29.jpg/500px-Vauxhall_Vagabond_%281953%29_%2833320873386%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Vauxhall_Vagabond_%281953%29_%2833320873386%29.jpg/1280px-Vauxhall_Vagabond_%281953%29_%2833320873386%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo